b. automated aiming, target snapping, tactical exploitation, unfair play,
   cheating, anti-cheat evasion, or bypassing platform security controls;

c. resource farming, economic manipulation, bulk-account creation or control,
   bot-as-a-service, commercial automation workflows, or commercial data-mining
   systems;

d. social impersonation or the training, deployment, or distribution of
   automated text-chat, voice, or emote modules;

e. real-world weaponization, harmful targeting, physical-system control,
   unlawful tracking, unlawful surveillance, or other use intended to injure,
   threaten, or materially disadvantage a person or group;

f. collection, reconstruction, deanonymization, disclosure, or exploitation of
   personal data, account identifiers, private communications, proprietary game
   assets, or other data obtained without valid rights and consent;

g. any unlawful activity or violation of applicable game, platform, service,
   privacy, intellectual-property, or access-control terms; or

h. circumvention of these restrictions through modification, fine-tuning,
   distillation, quantization, merging, repackaging, API access, hosted service,
   sublicensing, or redistribution.

