The public release is intended to contain processed, identifier-removed
research artifacts and reproducibility tools only. It does not grant permission
to recover or distribute source replays, unprocessed frames, private logs,
commercial assets, or platform data.

No fine-tuned checkpoint is included in the current public release. Any future
checkpoint release will occur no earlier than 90 days after publication and
only after privacy, intellectual-property, and security review. A future
checkpoint may also require separate access approval and additional terms.

